hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22883","Ibrahim narrated to us: Ibn Mubarak narrated to us, from Yunus, from az-Zuhri: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah ibn Masud narrated to me that a man of the companions of the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, narrated to him that he heard the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, say: When one of you is in prayer, let him not raise his sight to the heaven, lest his sight be snatched."
